<text_unit img="file:D:\jibju\04_008.jpg" id="論語集註大全-泰伯-04-01">
<hanmun_text>
<canon id="論語-泰伯-04-01">○曾子有疾。孟敬子問之。</canon>
<commentary commentator="朱熹" id="論語-泰伯-04-01-C01">孟敬子。魯大夫仲孫氏。名捷。問之者。問其疾也。</commentary>
</hanmun_text>
</text_unit>
</document>
</record>
